Recommends: clambhook-ui
Description: ClambHook core: C17 network daemon and license helper
 clambhook provides the GPL-3.0-only ClambHook core: a C17 network client
 daemon with the frozen HTTP/WebSocket control API, its systemd unit, and the
 license helper used for trial and license activation. The desktop controller
 and terminal dashboard ship in the separate clambhook-ui package. Supported
 on Ubuntu; packages and the apt repository are signed with the
 developer@jpfchang.org release key.
